;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\000.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\死月妖花.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Hands twisted and warped out of shape.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tree tendrils biting deep into the neck, the belly, the wrists.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="けいれん">Twitching</STYLE>, writhing extremities.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a form far too hideous to call human.<PG>
The face was unmistakably <STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE>, who I thought had vanished, been taken into <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, her body now under its control?<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\999.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　　am　　the　　one　　called　　Shigatsu　Youka"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>Itohime</STYLE>'s mouth cried out in a voice like someone else's, in halting words.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\地割れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n8000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the same time, tendrils like <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="むち">whips</STYLE> <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="は">crawled</STYLE> out from all around us at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if to <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="いかく">threaten</STYLE> us, the tendrils writhed all around us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"What the hell is this! It's gross...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Those are </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s hyphae!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, get blood on it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Got it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\鉈エフェクト横.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "200" "4" "100" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "4" "100" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE> put blood on the knife again and, with a flick, scattered a <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ひまつ">spray</STYLE> of blood all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "111" "11" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At that, the hyphae thrashed about as if struggling, and hid themselves away in the ground and inside the trees.<PG>
Just as <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> said, <STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan's</STYLE> blood seems to work powerfully against <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if we're to believe <STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE>'s words, <STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan's</STYLE> blood alone isn't enough to wither all the cherry trees blooming wild across these mountains.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\死月妖花.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "33!" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　am　　the　one　called　Shigatsu　Youka　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPN>"What's with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Is that all you can say!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, the hidden hyphae stretched out toward <STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE>, one after another.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\地割れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\春花縛り.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Whoa! Let go...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The hyphae coiled around <STYLE ID="6">Haruka's</STYLE> neck, wrists and ankles, and held her completely still.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　am　the one　　called　　Shigatsu　Youka"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>Then one strand of hypha picked up the syringe that had been lying on the ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Stop it! Let go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　am　the　one　called　Shigatsu　Youka"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\注射器菌糸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-550" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The syringe slowly drew closer to <STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,111,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\lcm\夏菜ナイフドローガ.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, something darted around <STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right after, the hyphae that had been gripping <STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE> slithered down into the ground.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\地割れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, are you okay!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE>, gripping a bloody knife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you saved me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE> was standing as if favoring one leg.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I thought, her leg injury is taking its toll.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\夏菜ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Everyone! Don't get away from me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan cut her own arm, leg and face with the knife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A single streak of blood ran from each one.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, be careful! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> blood only works if it's used right after it's shed!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then it's no good even if I smear my blood on everyone!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... That's right. That's where I failed."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜縦長.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ木.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "-540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
