Suddenly my body was swept upward, and then it hung still in midair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was floating at a height of 10 meters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hyphae had wrapped tight around my arms and legs, holding me up in the air.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Can't you help her!?"</STYLE>
