{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　am　　the one　　called　　Shigatsu　Youka―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　　am　</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">Urgh gh gh...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">　the one　　called　Shigatsu Youka"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13"><TXSPN>"Wake up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"I　am　　</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="13">Natsumi... san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> don't want this anymore, do you!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"My　　　wish　　　　　is"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>It was already 800 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We put down roots in the land named Arata and worked day after day to clear it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\雪山.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Fleeing that terrible war, months crossing steep mountains―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
we wanted, whatever it took, to make this land we had finally found rich.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That feeling spurred us on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\流るる時.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\昔荒田\荒田畑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hard at work, <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One of the attendants called out to the <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE>, but he grimaced a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\以仁王農民.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Enough with 'Prince,' I told you. I gave up my rank. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I even changed my name, to Niimura."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, it's like a nickname, isn't it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"A nickname, hm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what would you like to call me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Me...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tilling the field in clothes no different from a <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="げせん">lowly</STYLE> peasant's, the <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE> had spoken to me without warning.<PG>
"Hahaha! Asking a little one like <STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE> out of the blue how to address a <STYLE ID="6">prince</STYLE> only puts her on the spot!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmph, I suppose you're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. Forget I asked."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"U-uh!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I want to call you </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Nii-sama? As in 'big brother'? Ha, as if we were brother and sister."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... the Nii of Niimura. Nii-sama..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ah, I see."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\昔荒田\荒田風景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE>, the Emperor's son, had given up his rank and worked day after day to make this land richer than any other.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He took up farm tools himself and led the way in the hard work and the dirty work alike.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone came to trust <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE>, and day by day the land grew rich.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the same way, I felt my own heart growing richer day by day.<PG>
I was 11 then, and in time I grew toward womanhood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were times <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> treated me as he had when I was his attendant, and times he suddenly treated me as a woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then some years passed―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what do you want for your future? Will you live here forever?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes! I will always stay by your side, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">After all, my family has served the Emperor for generations."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But I'm no longer―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That is all right. I serve you because I want to serve you."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'re 15 now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Even in a settlement like this, it's about time you, as a woman..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, I mean... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Proper conduct, you know, that sort of... well..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> said so, his face bright red.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. I was already 15.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Old enough that there would be nothing strange about marrying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was that what <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> wanted to say?<PG>
But even if it came to marriage, someone of <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="いや">lowly</STYLE> birth like me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apart from me, they were all people of noble birth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They said my family had once been of some standing too, but from my grandparents' generation on, it had fallen into complete decline.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That someone like me could still be at <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama's</STYLE> side was the greatest happiness there could be.<PG>
But if some gentleman were to pass through this settlement and <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="みそ">take a fancy</STYLE> to someone like me―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I thought of that, just as <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> said, my conduct as a woman...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the one I wanted to take a fancy to me was―<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, are you all right? Your face is red."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="17">"Huh!!??"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With one offhand word from <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE>, I had let out an absurdly loud cry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why was my face red?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why was I so flustered?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why... 
{PAUSE ""}
was my heart pounding so hard?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\昔荒田\荒田風景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―From then on, I did my best to behave in a womanly way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I called up the gestures of my family and the ladies-in-waiting that I remembered, and tried imitating them.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\頼綱農民.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">? Hurt your leg?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, no, it is not that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I tried walking in a womanly way, the one close to <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> in age, <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="つなむね">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">-sama</STYLE>, said that to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I just couldn't do it well after all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, after <STYLE ID="13">Tsunamune-sama</STYLE> left, someone put a hand on my shoulder.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\以仁王農民.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, don't push yourself too hard. Little by little is fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> left me with those words and walked off toward <STYLE ID="13">Tsunamune-sama</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> understood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I was thinking, what I was trying to do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
even so... 
{PAUSE ""}
he would not know about this pounding of my heart.<PG>
Even if he had given up his rank, <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> and I...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, there was something I could not hold back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE>―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―But then, suddenly, that day came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a chilly day, when spring had only just arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\昔荒田\小屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"You're leaving here!? Tomorrow!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes... I mean to."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had come here because <STYLE ID="13">Tsunamune-sama</STYLE> called for me, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The conversation between <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Tsunamune-sama</STYLE> reached me from the hut at the edge of the settlement.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"This land is rich enough now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So tomorrow, I mean to leave it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I don't get it... What do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I was a prince by rank, but truly, I knew far too little of the world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">This country still has land upon land lying waste. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And there are people living on it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If there are people starving on barren soil, I want to help them."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"You want to use the knowledge and skills you gained here to make people in other lands rich?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes. </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s age will end soon, I expect. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Before then, I want to lay even a small </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="いしずえ">foundation</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> to make this country rich."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"I'll be honest. This land will be fine even if </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> leave. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'re the reason everyone has gained more than enough knowledge and skill to live on. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">But..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">―what about her?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Don't tell me you haven't noticed. The way </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> looks at </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">―you know, don't you?"</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I see. So the real reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'re leaving is..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I may have given up my rank, but if who I am ever became known, this settlement wouldn't get off lightly either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And if </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> knew, she'd say she was coming with me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So tomorrow I leave here quietly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If who I am got out, there's no telling what might happen to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So I―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"And how do </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> feel?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Forget what's around </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">. What do </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> think of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's..."</STYLE><PG>
I pressed my back against a tree near the hut and covered my mouth with both hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart was pounding so hard I thought a sound might slip out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was afraid to hear it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was afraid, but―
{PAUSE ""}
I covered not my ears, but my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without moving from that spot, I waited for <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama's</STYLE> words.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> still has something childlike about her, but she'll grow into a beautiful woman. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That beauty alone should win her the eye of the highest nobles."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, I'm going back to work."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Wait! That's not what I'm asking! I'm asking how </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> feel about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I gave up my rank! For me, of all people, to now―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I'm telling you, that's not what I asked!"</STYLE><PG>
