―The two of them left the hut without noticing me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I stayed as I was, unable to stand or move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even after my heartbeat calmed, even after my breathing calmed, I forgot to move the hands covering my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Spring had finally come, yet I stood frozen stiff, like a winter icicle.<PG>
