I slipped quietly out of the house too, and picked up the things I had readied beforehand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone lived in the same house, so getting out without waking anyone was no easy thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="21" RUBY="かわや">privy</STYLE> was outside, so at worst I could use that as my excuse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why I had left my things outside beforehand.<PG>
Before <STYLE ID="22" RUBY="あけぼの">dawn</STYLE>, the sky still dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A cold snap, I suppose you would call it; it was as cold as midwinter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I let out a breath, white steam rose like from a freshly boiled pot.<PG>
There was only one road leading out of this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ran down that road after <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE>.<PG>
