{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
Freezing air, nothing like spring. A thin skin of ice had formed over the puddles.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hugging my arms to myself and hunching small, I trotted after him.<PG>
But even though I was chasing after <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE> like this, would he take me with him?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was not clever enough to persuade <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama</STYLE>, and in the end I never thought of any good plan.<PG>
I had no thought of persuading him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I had been able to learn <STYLE ID="6">Nii-sama's</STYLE> feelings, if only a little.
