{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I knew </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> were listening at the hut."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> set it up on purpose, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> would hear..."</STYLE><PG>
