{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No! Absolutely not!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　I didn't just give up my rank―if I'm found, I'll be executed as a traitor. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">You understand how dangerous it is to be with me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... </STYLE>
