<STYLE ID="2">come from a family that has served the Emperor for generations. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="25" RUBY="いや">Lowly</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> in birth, yet permitted to serve the Emperor, a </STYLE><STYLE ID="26" RUBY="けう">rare</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> family―</STYLE>
