<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I can't take </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> with me after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">It isn't because </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'d be a burden. It's precisely because I fear for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
