<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, this won't do... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I'll make you one promise. I want you to remember it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A promise...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Kiyomori's reign should end soon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Then I'll be able to walk the outside world in safety. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">About... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">within 10 years, that time will come."</STYLE>
