{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ten years is a long time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">In times like these, 10 years can change the world beyond recognition. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">This Arata too will change greatly. </STYLE>
