<BR>
It was the moment my heart pounded harder than it ever had.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that freezing wind, my surroundings alone were as warm as a sunken hearth in midsummer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hands and feet burned, my face flushed, my breath quickened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ten years... 
